<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="csrf-token" content="<%= csrfToken %>" />
  <title>Super Admin - Live Chat</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #0ea5e9;
      --primary-dark: #0284c7;
      --bg: #f8fafc;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --text: #0f172a;
      --subtle: #64748b;
      --border: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }
    body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); margin: 0; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; }
    header { background: var(--surface); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 14px 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    header h1 { font-size: 18px; margin: 0; color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700; }
    .who { margin-left: auto; font-size: 12px; color: var(--subtle); }
    .who b { color: var(--primary-dark); }
    main { max-width: 760px; margin: 32px auto; padding: 0 20px; }
    .card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); }
    .card h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 17px; }
    .card p { color: var(--subtle); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .row-actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    a.btnx { text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block; }
    a.btnx.primary { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; }
    a.btnx.primary:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); color: #fff; }
    a.btnx.ghost { border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text); }
    a.btnx.ghost:hover { border-color: var(--primary); color: var(--primary-dark); }
    .events { margin-top: 22px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); }
    .events h2 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 17px; }
    .events .muted { color: var(--subtle); font-size: 13px; margin: 0 0 14px; }
    table.ev { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
    table.ev th, table.ev td { text-align: left; padding: 8px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); vertical-align: top; }
    table.ev th { color: var(--subtle); font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.03em; }
    .tag { display: inline-block; padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; }
    .tag.success { background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }
    .tag.failure { background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; }
    .tag.denied { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
    .empty { color: var(--subtle); font-size: 13px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Super Admin</h1>
    <span class="who"><%= adminUser %> &middot; <b>SUPER ADMIN</b></span>
  </header>
  <main>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Pemantauan Akun Admin</h2>
      <p>Anda login sebagai <b>Super Admin</b> dengan hak administratif global.</p>
      <p>Dashboard pemantauan dan pengelolaan akun admin seluruh rumah sakit akan tersedia pada tahap berikutnya.</p>
      <p>Akun ini <b>tidak</b> memiliki akses ke isi percakapan pasien.</p>
      <div class="row-actions">
        <a class="btnx primary" href="/admin/change-password">Ganti Password</a>
        <a class="btnx ghost" href="/admin/logout">Logout</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="events">
      <h2>Aktivitas Terakhir</h2>
      <p class="muted">20 event audit terbaru (login, aktivasi, reset, perubahan password). Tidak memuat password, token, atau isi chat.</p>
      <% if (events && events.length) { %>
        <table class="ev">
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Waktu</th><th>Aksi</th><th>Aktor</th><th>Target</th><th>Hasil</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <% events.forEach(function (e) { %>
              <tr>
                <td><%= new Date(e.created_at).toLocaleString('id-ID') %></td>
                <td><%= e.action %></td>
                <td><%= e.actor_username || '-' %><% if (e.actor_role) { %> <span class="muted">(<%= e.actor_role %>)</span><% } %></td>
                <td><%= e.target_username || '-' %></td>
                <td><span class="tag <%= e.result %>"><%= e.result %></span></td>
              </tr>
            <% }); %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      <% } else { %>
        <p class="empty">Belum ada aktivitas tercatat.</p>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
